                        </div>
                        <div class="medal">
                            <div class="medal-icon gold-2">🥈</div>
                            <div class="medal-label">2nd Prize</div>
                            <div class="medal-weight">6 grams Gold Medal</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="medal">
                            <div class="medal-icon gold-3">🥉</div>
                            <div class="medal-label">3rd Prize</div>
                            <div class="medal-weight">6 grams Gold Medal</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <a href="/register" class="participate-btn">Participate Now →</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Gita Recitation Contest -->
            <div class="contest-card">
                <span class="contest-icon">📖</span>
                <h3>Bhagavad Gita Recitation</h3>
                <p>Showcase your devotion through the melodious recitation of sacred verses from the Bhagavad Gita.</p>
                
                <div class="prizes-section">
                    <div class="prizes-title">🏅 Gold Medal Prizes</div>
                    <div class="medals">
                        <div class="medal">
                            <div class="medal-icon gold-1">🥇</div>
                            <div class="medal-label">1st Prize</div>
                            <div class="medal-weight">6 grams Gold Medal</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="medal">
                            <div class="medal-icon gold-2">🥈</div>
                            <div class="medal-label">2nd Prize</div>
                            <div class="medal-weight">6 grams Gold Medal</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="medal">
                            <div class="medal-icon gold-3">🥉</div>
                            <div class="medal-label">3rd Prize</div>
                            <div class="medal-weight">6 grams Gold Medal</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <a href="/register" class="participate-btn">Participate Now →</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Devotional Singing Contest -->
            <div class="contest-card">
                <span class="contest-icon">🎵</span>
                <h3>Devotional Singing</h3>
                <p>Offer your heartfelt bhajans and kirtans. Let your voice celebrate the glory of Lord Krishna.</p>
                
                <div class="prizes-section">
                    <div class="prizes-title">🏅 Gold Medal Prizes</div>
                    <div class="medals">
                        <div class="medal">
                            <div class="medal-icon gold-1">🥇</div>
                            <div class="medal-label">1st Prize</div>
                            <div class="medal-weight">6 grams Gold Medal</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="medal">
                            <div class="medal-icon gold-2">🥈</div>
                            <div class="medal-label">2nd Prize</div>
                            <div class="medal-weight">6 grams Gold Medal</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="medal">
                            <div class="medal-icon gold-3">🥉</div>
                            <div class="medal-label">3rd Prize</div>
                            <div class="medal-weight">6 grams Gold Medal</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <a href="/register" class="participate-btn">Participate Now →</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="about-section">
            <h2>About The Organizer</h2>
            <p>
                Organized by the <strong>International Society for Krishna Consciousness (ISKCON) Tirupati</strong>, 
                this national contest aims to promote devotional culture, spiritual education, and creative 
                expression across India. Join us in celebrating the timeless teachings and divine pastimes 
                of Lord Krishna.
            </p>
            <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Srila Prabhupada" class="logo-img1" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer-content">
            <p><strong>International Society for Krishna Consciousness (ISKCON), Tirupati</strong></p>
            <p><strong>Registered Address:</strong> Hare Krishna Land, Hare Krishna Road, Vinayaka Nagar, Tirupati - 517501, Andhra Pradesh, India.</p>
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@iskconcontest.org">support@iskconcontest.org</a> | <strong>Phone:</strong> +91-9493805059</p>
            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="/about">About</a>
                <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
                <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>
                <a href="/terms">Terms & Conditions</a>
                <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a>
            </div>
            <p style="margin-top: 25px; color: #78909c;">© 2026 BhakthiVedanta Wisdom Contest. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        function toggleMenu() {
            const navLinks = document.getElementById('navLinks');
            navLinks.classList.toggle('active');
        }

        document.addEventListener('click', function(event) {
            const navLinks = document.getElementById('navLinks');
            const menuToggle = document.querySelector('.menu-toggle');
            
            if (!navLinks.contains(event.target) && !menuToggle.contains(event.target)) {
                navLinks.classList.remove('active');
            }
        });
    </script>

</body>
</html>
